<div class="meleft">
    <p class="info">Hey, I'm Malaika! I work on <a href="https://www.databricks.com/product/lakewatch">Lakewatch</a> at Databricks, building a security platform for the agentic era.</p>

    <p class="info">I am excited by</p>
    <ul class="info">
    <li>designing agents for specific tasks, multi-agent systems, and understanding the nature of (their) cognition</li>
    <li>automation of discovery in the mathematical and life sciences</li>
    <li>tools for thinking, communicating, creating, and working better</li>
    <li>mathematical elegance: complexity and correctness of algorithms, discrete sets, types</li>
    </ul>

    <p class="info">I also love printmaking and <a href="https://malaikaaiyar.me/posts/pottery">pottery</a>, documenting my life <a href="https://malaikaaiyar.me/posts/gallery">visually</a> and <a href="https://malaikaaiyar.me/posts/sheet/">analytically</a>, hosting, <a href="https://www.mixcloud.com/oxideradio_live/pocket-melody-3-26-february-2026/">spiritual jazz</a> among many other genres of music, <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cirque_Calder">these</a> <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fondation_Maeght">20th</a> <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Der_Blaue_Reiter">century</a> artist projects, newsletters/<a href="https://www.follymagazine.org/">magazines</a>/print media, <a href="https://malaikaaiyar.me/posts/exercise/">embodiment</a>, spontaneity.</p>

    <p class="info">Before this I studied computer science at Oxford, did research with the <a href="https://torrvision.com/">Torr Vision Group</a> on <a href="https://openreview.net/forum?id=Ii56BVBZjj">AI for biology</a>. I was a software engineer at <a href="https://granola.so">Granola</a>, <a href="https://standard.ai">Standard AI</a>, and <a href="https://malaikaaiyar.me/work">more</a>. I ran and scaled up <a href="https://orchard.day/">orchard.day</a> and <a href="https://ensemble.rodeo">ensemble.rodeo</a>, interdisciplinary communities that brought together over 500 makers in the UK.</p>

    <p class="info">In this phase of life, I'm learning a ton and building my new life here. You will find me in San Francisco, but my heart is still in England, where I spent the last 8 years. <a href="mailto:malaika.aiyar@gmail.com">Reach out</a> if you'd like to chat!</p>

    <p class="yours">Yours, <br/>
    Malaika</p>

